ed them "},{"t":"up","s":["H1104"],"a":[13]},{"t":" and their "},{"t":"households","s":["H1004"],"a":[15]},{"t":" and their "},{"t":"tents","s":["H0168"],"a":[17]},{"t":" and all their "},{"t":"substance","s":["H3351"],"a":[20]},{"t":" that went with them, from the "},{"t":"midst","s":["H7130"],"a":[23]},{"t":" of all "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[25]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"But it is your eyes that have seen all the great work of Jehovah which He did.","tok":[{"t":"But it is your "},{"t":"eyes","s":["H5869"],"a":[1]},{"t":" that have "},{"t":"seen","s":["H7200"],"a":[2]},{"t":" all the "},{"t":"great","s":["H1419"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"work","s":["H4639"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[6]},{"t":" which He "},{"t":"did","s":["H6213"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"Therefore you shall keep the whole commandment which I am commanding you today so that you may be strong and that you may go in and possess the land into which you are crossing over to possess,","tok":[{"t":"Therefore you shall "},{"t":"keep","s":["H8104"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the whole "},{"t":"commandment","s":["H4687"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"which","s":["H0834"],"a":[4]},{"t":" I am "},{"t":"commanding","s":["H6680"],"a":[6]},{"t":" you today so that you may be "},{"t":"strong","s":["H2388"],"a":[9]},{"t":" and that you may "},{"t":"go","s":["H5674"],"a":[16]},{"t":" "},{"t":"in","s":["H0935"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"possess","s":["H3423"],"a":[11]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[13]},{"t":" into which you are crossing over to "},{"t":"possess","s":["H3423"],"a":[18]},{"t":","}]},{"n":9,"text":"And so that you may extend your days upon the ground which Jehovah swore to your fathers, to give to them and to their seed, a land flowing with milk and honey.","tok":[{"t":"And so that you may extend your "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[2]},{"t":" upon the "},{"t":"ground","s":["H0127"],"a":[4]},{"t":" which "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[7]},